  PROPOSED
  PENDING_ACCEPTANCE
  ACCEPTED
  ACTIVE
  AT_RISK
  OVERDUE
  PARTIALLY_COMPLETED
  COMPLETED
  VERIFIED
  DISPUTED
  RESOLVED
  CANCELLED
  EXPIRED
  FAILED
